201	   * Instead, we verify the stronger invariant: the input *element itself*
202	   * survives the poll tick without being unmounted. If the DOM is rebuilt
203	   * (e.g., `innerHTML` is replaced), the input reference becomes stale and
204	   * `app.querySelector('.title-edit-input')` returns null. This is the actual
